├── alphazede-sports/      AZS — fantasy + sports betting      [git: alphazede/alphazede-sports]
│   ├── command_node/ data_node/ services/  distributed runtime
│   ├── apps/ frontend/ packages/           Next.js / TypeScript
│   ├── hardware/ infra/ deploy/            FPGA + fleet
│   └── agents/ docs/ tools/ tests/ Vnv/ Security/
